License: GPL-2.0-or-later (see COPYING and the headers in each file).

Files are copied unchanged from libjbig/ in the tarball (jbig.c, jbig.h,
jbig_ar.c, jbig_ar.h), plus COPYING from the top level. The filter uses
the encoder through src/compat/hp_jbig.c. The test script builds a decoder
from the same jbig.c (tests/jbigdec.c).
